#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:9
msgid "Assembly input and rejected selections"
msgstr "装配输入与拒绝规则"

msgid ""
"The authored configuration authority is one schema-2 TOML assembly. SoC "
"and Board facts remain maintained JSON; `resolved.json` is output, not "
"an authored alternative. CMake owns software dependencies. Failed TOML "
"resolution never falls back to Kconfig, cache variables, schema-1 JSON "
"or old generated headers. Legacy JSON assemblies are rejected as inputs,"
" not retained as an alternate authoring interface."
msgstr ""
"人工编写的配置权威是一份 schema-2 TOML assembly。SoC 和 Board facts 仍为维护的 "
"JSON；`resolved.json` 是输出，不是另一种人工编写入口。CMake 拥有软件依赖。TOML 解析失败不会回退到 "
"Kconfig、cache 变量、schema-1 JSON 或旧生成头文件。旧 JSON 装配作为输入会被拒绝，不保留为另一种编写接口。"

msgid ""
"The parser creates immutable `AuthoredAssembly` intent. Production "
"consumers use `resolve_ir()` and named immutable `ConfigurationIR` "
"decisions; only audit and artifact-boundary consumers request "
"`to_dict()`. Typed source epoch 2 and the schema-1 JSON output "
"projection are separate contracts. The [source compatibility "
"policy](../../design/source-compatibility.md) owns their version "
"declarations; neither introduces firmware metadata or runtime dispatch."
msgstr ""
"解析器创建不可变 `AuthoredAssembly` 意图。生产消费者使用 `resolve_ir()` 与具名、不可变的 "
"`ConfigurationIR` 决策；只有审计和产物边界消费者调用 `to_dict()`。Typed source epoch 2 与 "
"schema-1 JSON 输出投影是不同合同，其版本声明由[源码兼容策略](../../design/source-compatibility"
".md)维护；两者均不引入固件元数据或运行时分发。"

