#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:40
msgid ""
"Resource checks cover actual pin/AF, controller, IRQ ceiling, shared "
"timer/timebase, physical DMA controller/stream, clock, exact memory domain, "
"mode and endpoint identity. A syntactically valid selector can still reject "
"because that provider does not implement the route. The resolver never "
"silently changes pins, modes or clock."
msgstr ""
"资源检查覆盖实际引脚／AF、控制器、IRQ 系统调用优先级阈值、共享定时器／时间基准、物理 DMA "
"控制器／流、时钟、准确内存域、模式及端点身份。即使选择项语法合法，仍可能因提供者未实现该路由而被拒绝。解析器绝不静默改变引脚、模式或时钟。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:45
msgid ""
"See the [configuration and ownership guide](../../guides/developer-"
"workflow.md) for Board-first queries, validated profiles, human summaries "
"and effective diffs. `explain` defaults to human-readable output; automation"
" must select `--json`."
msgstr ""
"[配置与所有权指南](../../guides/developer-workflow.md)说明从 Board 查询、经验证的 "
"profile、人读摘要及有效差异。`explain` 默认输出人读内容；自动化必须选择 `--json`。"

msgid ""
"Every generated bundle contains `nexus_factory_strong.h`. "
"Application code can include it and use nominal references such as "
"`NX_UART_REF_UART0` with `nx_factory_uart_ref`; no `[factory]` "
"selection enables that header. `factory.strong` is not a supported "
"field and rejects as unknown. The optional `capabilities = true` "
"selection emits immutable mode metadata separately from the "
"interface faces. Factory getters return existing static objects and "
"do not start hardware."
msgstr ""
"每个生成 bundle 都包含 `nexus_factory_strong.h`。应用代码可以包含该头文件，并将 "
"`NX_UART_REF_UART0` 这类具有独立类型的引用传给 `nx_factory_uart_ref`；无需通过 "
"`[factory]` 选择启用该头文件。`factory.strong` 不是受支持字段，会因未知字段而被拒绝。可选的 "
"`capabilities = true` 选择会生成不可变的模式元数据，与接口面分开。factory getter "
"返回既有静态对象，不启动硬件。"

msgid "Physical Flash and the selected image"
msgstr "物理 Flash 与所选镜像"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:60
msgid ""
"`flash` in the resolved output describes the complete physical device, "
"including its exact erase and programming geometry. `layout` selects the "
"physical erase owner that contains the executable image. Without an authored"
" `layout`, that owner is the complete physical Flash. Products still own "
"writable regions and recovery; this selection grants no Flash access control"
" or protection."
msgstr ""
"解析输出中的 `flash` 描述完整物理器件，包括精确的擦除与编程几何。`layout` 选择包含可执行镜像的物理擦除区。未编写 `layout` "
"时，该区域为完整物理 Flash。可写区域和恢复仍由产品负责；此选择不提供 Flash 访问控制或写保护。"

msgid "A `layout` JSON file has `schema_version = 1` and `regions`. Each region has an `id`, integer `origin`, positive `size` and `kind` (`image` or `data`). Exactly one region is an image. IDs must be unique; all regions must be nonoverlapping, within physical Flash, and start/end on its exact erase boundaries. This is an auxiliary layout input; schema-1 JSON assemblies remain rejected."
msgstr "`layout` JSON 文件包含 `schema_version = 1` 和 `regions`。各 region 具有 `id`、整数 `origin`、正数 `size` 和 `kind`（`image` 或 `data`）。只能有一个 image region。ID 必须唯一；全部 region 必须互不重叠、位于物理 Flash 内，并从其精确擦除边界开始、结束。这是辅助 layout 输入；schema-1 JSON 装配仍然拒绝。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:72
msgid "Executable prefix and suffix"
msgstr "执行区的前缀与尾部保留量"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:74
msgid ""
"The optional `[memory]` fields reserve bytes inside the selected physical "
"owner. Both fields are unsigned 32-bit byte counts with a default of zero. "
"Booleans, floats, negative values and values above `4294967295` reject. "
"Zero-valued fields are omitted from the resolved projection. They preserve "
"the existing default layout, linked addresses and budgets; source changes "
"still change source and configuration identities."
msgstr ""
"可选的 `[memory]` 字段在选定物理擦除区内部保留字节。两个字段均为无符号 32 位字节数，默认值为零。布尔值、浮点数、负数以及大于 "
"`4294967295` 的值均拒绝。零值字段不写入解析投影。零值保留现有默认布局、链接地址和预算；源码变更仍会改变源码与配置身份。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:29
msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:29
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:29
msgid "`image_prefix_bytes`"
msgstr "`image_prefix_bytes`"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:29
msgid "Reserved bytes before the executable vector table"
msgstr "可执行向量表之前保留的字节数"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:29
msgid "`image_suffix_bytes`"
msgstr "`image_suffix_bytes`"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:29
msgid "Reserved bytes after the executable load window"
msgstr "执行加载窗口之后保留的字节数"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:86
msgid ""
"`ConfigurationIR` derives the executable origin and size from its immutable "
"`FlashRegionIR` owner and `MemoryBudgetIR` reservations. `PhysicalPartIR` "
"remains the sole physical geometry authority; the JSON `layout` projection "
"retains that geometry for audit. No independent executable address or CMake "
"address override is authored."
msgstr ""
"`ConfigurationIR` 根据不可变的 `FlashRegionIR` 物理擦除区和 `MemoryBudgetIR` "
"保留量派生执行起点与大小。`PhysicalPartIR` 仍是物理几何的唯一权威；JSON `layout` "
"投影保留该几何用于审计。用户不另行编写执行地址，也不通过 CMake 覆盖地址。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:99
msgid ""
"The physical owner remains erase-aligned and nonoverlapping. Its executable "
"window need not start on an erase boundary. The prefix plus suffix must be "
"less than the owner size and leave a complete reset vector. The derived "
"window must stay inside that owner without address overflow. An explicit "
"`flash_load_limit_bytes` cannot exceed the executable size; the default "
"Flash budget uses that size. Reserved prefix/suffix bytes do not count as "
"actual ELF LOAD bytes and do not change the physical Flash API."
msgstr ""
"物理擦除区仍须按擦除边界对齐，且各区不得重叠。其内部执行窗口无需从擦除边界开始。前缀与尾部之和必须小于物理区大小，并留出完整复位向量。派生窗口必须位于该物理区内，地址不得溢出。显式"
" `flash_load_limit_bytes` 不得超过执行区大小；默认 Flash 预算采用执行区大小。前缀与尾部的保留字节不计为实际 ELF "
"LOAD 字节，也不改变物理 Flash API。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:107
msgid ""
"The reviewed offset and nonzero-reservation profiles are STM32F407VET6, "
"STM32F407ZGT6 and GD32F470ZGT6. They require complete physical erase "
"geometry and a 512-byte-aligned executable vector base, including when the "
"physical owner starts at the reset address. Other SoCs and external provider"
" packages gain no prefix/suffix support from these fields. The maintained "
"profile owns that exact alignment and its actual vendor vector symbol; "
"authored or artifact metadata cannot grant another startup that capability."
msgstr ""
"已复核的偏移及非零保留量配置仅包括 STM32F407VET6、STM32F407ZGT6 和 "
"GD32F470ZGT6。它们要求完整物理擦除几何，执行向量起点必须按 512 字节对齐；即使物理擦除区从复位地址开始也一样。其他 SoC 和外置 "
"provider "
"包不会因填写这些字段而获得前缀或尾部支持。精确对齐要求和真实厂商向量符号由维护中的配置合同决定；人工输入或产物元数据不能给其他启动实现授予该能力。"

msgid "For example, this complete layout file selects the final 384 KiB of Sky STM32F407VET6 Flash. Select it with the assembly's `layout` path. The decimal origin is `0x08020000`; the omitted first 128 KiB is not another selected image and is not protected from writes by this layout."
msgstr "例如，这个完整 layout 文件选择天空星 STM32F407VET6 Flash 的最后 384 KiB。通过装配的 `layout` 路径选择它。十进制 origin 对应 `0x08020000`；省略的前 128 KiB 不是另一个所选镜像，也不会因本 layout 而获得写保护。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:134
msgid ""
"For an offset image or nonzero reservations, generated linker checks require"
" `.isr_vector` at the derived executable origin, correct alignment, a "
"nonempty table no larger than 512 bytes, and the actual vendor symbol at the"
" section base: `g_pfnVectors` for F407 or `__gVectors` for GD470. The "
"reviewed startup sets VTOR from that linked symbol with the required "
"barriers. Default zero-reservation reset-address linking keeps its existing "
"semantics."
msgstr ""
"对于偏移镜像或非零保留量，生成的链接检查要求 `.isr_vector` 位于派生的执行起点、满足对齐、向量表非空且不超过 512 "
"字节，并要求真实厂商符号位于该 section 起点：F407 为 `g_pfnVectors`，GD470 为 "
"`__gVectors`。已复核的启动代码由该链接符号设置 VTOR，并执行所需屏障。默认零保留量、复位地址链接保持原有语义。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:141
msgid ""
"ELF LOAD bounds, Flash capacity and footprint use the derived executable "
"window. The resource checker independently validates the physical owner, "
"reservations, vector words, reset entry and all actual Flash LOAD ranges "
"against that window. ELF-to-BIN checks reconstruct bytes from the executable"
" origin. They add no prefix or suffix bytes. Physical erase/program facts "
"and RAM budgets remain unchanged; use `flash`, not `layout.origin`, to "
"interpret erase geometry."
msgstr ""
"ELF LOAD 边界、Flash 容量与占用跨度均采用派生的执行窗口。资源检查器会独立核对物理擦除区、保留量、向量字、复位入口，以及所有真实 "
"Flash LOAD 范围是否符合该窗口。ELF-to-BIN 检查从执行起点重建字节，不添加前缀或尾部内容。物理擦除/编程事实和 RAM "
"预算保持不变；解释擦除几何应使用 `flash`，不能以 `layout.origin` 重新编号。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:148
msgid ""
"The complete [public image-window reference](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/cmake/package/verification/image_window/README.md) selects a 128 KiB "
"F407 sector owner at `[0x08020000, 0x08040000)`. Its 512-byte prefix and "
"1,024-byte suffix derive `[0x08020200, 0x0803fc00)`, or 129,536 bytes, for "
"vectors and executable LOADs. The reference links the actual reviewed "
"startup through the installed SDK; its declared 2,048-byte MSP is not a "
"measured stack peak."
msgstr ""
"完整的[公开执行窗口参考](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/cmake/package/verification/image_window/README.md)选择 F407 的一个 128 KiB"
" 扇区 `[0x08020000, 0x08040000)`。512 字节前缀和 1,024 字节尾部派生出 `[0x08020200, "
"0x0803fc00)` 执行区，共 129,536 字节，用于向量表与执行 LOAD。该参考通过安装 SDK 链接真实已复核的启动代码；声明的 "
"2,048 字节 MSP 并非实测堆栈峰值。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:155
msgid ""
"Complete F407 assembly with explicit byte reservations; layout.json is part "
"of the linked public reference."
msgstr "带显式字节保留量的完整 F407 装配；layout.json 位于链接的公开参考中。"

#: docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:160
msgid ""
"A prefix reservation does not create an image header. A suffix reservation "
"does not create a trailer, activation marker or rollback record. Products "
"supply any metadata format, keys, Flash permissions and recovery policy. The"
" platform does not build a bootloader or authenticate, install, activate or "
"boot this image."
msgstr ""
"前缀保留量不会生成镜像头。尾部保留量不会生成 trailer、激活标记或回滚记录。元数据格式、密钥、Flash "
"权限与恢复策略均由产品提供。平台不会构建引导器，也不负责认证、安装、激活或引导此镜像。"

msgid "An offset executable still needs a product-owned boot path that reaches its vendor reset entry with valid initial machine state. Linking, vector checks and BIN identity do not execute that path. This mechanism does not provide image authentication, activation, A/B rollback, Flash permissions or a general running image handoff. Baremetal or FreeRTOS links prove their build scope only. In particular, the existing F407 handoff retains PRIMASK=1 and startup does not unmask it; no FreeRTOS handoff qualification follows from an offset link."
msgstr "偏移可执行文件仍需要产品拥有的启动路径，在有效初始机器状态下进入其 vendor reset entry。链接、向量检查和 BIN 身份不会执行这条路径。该机制不提供镜像认证、激活、A/B 回滚、Flash 权限或通用运行态镜像交接。裸机或 FreeRTOS 链接只证明各自构建范围。尤其是现有 F407 handoff 保留 PRIMASK=1，startup 不主动解除屏蔽；偏移链接不能建立 FreeRTOS handoff 资格。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:49
msgid "Inspect and generate"
msgstr "检查并生成"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:51
msgid "Run from the repository root, using a new output you own:"
msgstr "从仓库根目录执行，使用自己拥有的新输出："

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:60
msgid ""
"`check` and `explain` do not generate output. `generate` publishes one "
"atomic owned bundle; failure invalidates its owned output without replacing "
"unrelated data. Inspect `resolved.json`, input identities, generated "
"`nexus_config.h`, bindings, factory, linker memory and budgets. Changing "
"declared inputs requires a fresh resolution; separate Board/backend "
"combinations use separate build roots."
msgstr ""
"`check` 与 `explain` 不生成输出。`generate` 发布一个原子自有 bundle；失败使其自有输出失效，不替换无关数据。检查 "
"`resolved.json`、输入身份、生成的 "
"`nexus_config.h`、绑定、factory、链接器内存和预算。声明输入变化要求重新解析；不同 Board/backend "
"组合使用独立构建根目录。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/reference/configuration/assembly.md:66
msgid ""
"CPU-only Runtime has a separate authored runtime TOML using the shared CPU "
"resolver. It emits Core/Arch/optional OS policy, no "
"SoC/Board/startup/factory. Do not use it to claim a full device platform. "
"The [build contract](../../design/build-system.md), [integration "
"contract](../../design/integration-contracts.md) and production field "
"model/schema own detailed accepted fields; editor completion does not "
"establish hardware capability."
msgstr ""
"CPU-only Runtime 使用独立人工编写的 runtime TOML 和共享 CPU 解析器。它只生成 Core/Arch/可选 OS "
"策略，不生成 SoC/Board/startup/factory。不得据此声明完整设备平台。[构建合同](../../design/build-"
"system.md)、[接入合同](../../design/integration-contracts.md)和生产字段模型／schema "
"拥有详细合法字段；编辑器补全不建立硬件能力。"
